       DNN language packs install culture files into these same folders. The LogicalName mapping
       below additionally exposes each file to IStringLocalizer<T> under its marker type in
       Website/Localization/, which is what AddLocalization(ResourcesPath = "Resources") expects.
       Culture-specific files keep their own entry so they become satellite assemblies rather than
